      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50C57C007E0020B2ECB2ECD558C796C544007E000AAE30B300C5D00020BABB0020BBF8CE58B294AC78007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\\",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF005C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하바네로 페스티벌!\n미르의 명물이 될 수 있을까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 4976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558BC14B124B85C0020D398C2A4D2F0BC8C0021000ABBF8B974C7580020BA85BB3CC7740020B4200020C2180020C788C744AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실망시켰다간\n1성급이 될 수도 있을걸!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 5032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4B9DDC2DCCF30B2E4AC04000A0031C131AE09C7740020B4200020C218B3C40020C788C744AC7800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이렇게 정열적인 기술이 다 있다니!\n스코빌 지수가 한계를 돌파했어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 5076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B807AC8C0020C815C5F4C801C7780020AE30C220C7740020B2E40020C788B2E4B2C80021000AC2A4CF54BE4C0020C9C0C218AC000020D55CACC4B97C0020B3CCD30CD588C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "머리가 띵해지는 매운맛!\n하바네로 페스티벌은 최고야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA38B9ACAC000020B775D574C9C0B2940020B9E4C6B4B9DB0021000AD558BC14B124B85C0020D398C2A4D2F0BC8CC7400020CD5CACE0C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리스토란테 이류도\n곧 있으면 3성급이 되겠는데!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 5212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACC2A4D1A0B780D14C0020C774B958B3C4000AACE70020C788C73CBA7400200033C131AE09C7740020B418ACA0B294B37000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿b",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 5268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "위장이 약한 편이긴 한데\n도전해 보려구요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
