      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하바네로엑기스의 타오르는 듯한 빛깔!\n보기만 해도 배가 다 아파요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 5328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558BC14B124B85CC5D1AE30C2A4C7580020D0C0C624B974B2940020B4EFD55C0020BE5BAE540021000ABCF4AE30B9CC0020D574B3C40020BC30AC000020B2E40020C544D30CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "최고의 매운맛이었어요!\n화장실을 전세 내야겠지만요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 5404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CACE0C7580020B9E4C6B4B9DBC774C5C8C5B4C6940021000AD654C7A5C2E4C7440020C804C1380020B0B4C57CACA0C9C0B9CCC694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿f",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 102,
      "offsetInSection": 5468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스코빌런...\n무서워서 별로 안 좋아하는데...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 103,
      "offsetInSection": 5480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CF54BE4CB7F0002E002E002E000ABB34C11CC6CCC11C0020BCC4B85C0020C5480020C88BC544D558B294B370002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스코빌런의\n향기는 어떨지 궁금해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 104,
      "offsetInSection": 5536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CF54BE4CB7F0C758000AD5A5AE30B2940020C5B4B5A8C9C00020AD81AE08D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강렬한 향기!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 105,
      "offsetInSection": 5576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15B82CD55C0020D5A5AE3000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스코빌런이 좋아졌어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 106,
      "offsetInSection": 5592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CF54BE4CB7F0C7740020C88BC544C84CC5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "향기만 맡았는데 눈물이 나!\n스코빌런! 아이 러브 유!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 107,
      "offsetInSection": 5616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5A5AE30B9CC0020B9E1C558B294B3700020B208BB3CC7740020B0980021000AC2A4CF54BE4CB7F000210020C544C7740020B7ECBE0C0020C72000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿l",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 108,
      "offsetInSection": 5680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하바네로 페스티벌이라니,\n정신 나간 축제로군",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 109,
      "offsetInSection": 5692,
