      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대체 어떤 사람이\n이런 걸 기획한 걸까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 110,
      "offsetInSection": 5744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300CCB40020C5B4B5A40020C0ACB78CC774000AC774B7F00020AC780020AE30D68DD55C0020AC78AE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "캬~!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 111,
      "offsetInSection": 5792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEAC007E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하바네로엑기스!\n정말 대단한 기술이군!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 112,
      "offsetInSection": 5800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558BC14B124B85CC5D1AE30C2A40021000AC815B9D00020B300B2E8D55C0020AE30C220C774AD7000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "온몸의 세포가\n깨어난 기분이에요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 113,
      "offsetInSection": 5844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C628BAB8C7580020C138D3ECAC00000AAE68C5B4B09C0020AE30BD84C774C5D0C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿r",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 114,
      "offsetInSection": 5884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모든 테이블에 있는 요리에\n하바네로엑기스를 끼얹어 주셨군요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 115,
      "offsetInSection": 5896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B4E00020D14CC774BE14C5D00020C788B2940020C694B9ACC5D0000AD558BC14B124B85CC5D1AE30C2A4B97C0020B07CC5B9C5B40020C8FCC168AD70C6940021001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "매운맛의!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 116,
      "offsetInSection": 5972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E4C6B4B9DBC75800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "매운맛에 의한!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 117,
      "offsetInSection": 5984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E4C6B4B9DBC5D00020C758D55C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "매운맛을 위한!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 118,
      "offsetInSection": 6004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E4C6B4B9DBC7440020C704D55C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하바네로 페스티벌!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 119,
      "offsetInSection": 6024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558BC14B124B85C0020D398C2A4D2F0BC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3성급이 되는 것도 보람 있는 일이지만\n오늘처럼 손님들이 웃는 모습을 보니<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n정말 보람이 넘치네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 120,
      "offsetInSection": 6048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0033C131AE09C7740020B418B2940020AC83B3C40020BCF4B78C0020C788B2940020C77CC774C9C0B9CC000AC624B298CC98B7FC0020C190B2D8B4E4C7740020C6C3B2940020BAA8C2B5C7440020BCF4B2C800100001BE00000AC815B9D00020BCF4B78CC7740020B118CE58B124C694002E001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이게 다\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨와 스코빌런 덕분이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 121,
      "offsetInSection": 6172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC8C0020B2E4000A00100002010000000020C528C6400020C2A4CF54BE4CB7F00020B355BD84C774C5D0C694002E001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 하바네로 페스티벌은 대성공!\n정말 감사합니다!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 122,
      "offsetInSection": 6232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020D558BC14B124B85C0020D398C2A4D2F0BC8CC7400020B300C131ACF50021000AC815B9D00020AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E400210021001000020114013B0000",
